### Users list
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### User roles
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/users/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create user
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "fullName": "Alex Manager",
  "telegramUsername": "alex_manager",
  "telegramWork": "@alex_work",
  "role": "ProjectManager",
  "password": "StrongPass123",
  "isActive": true
}

### Patch user
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/users/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "telegramWork": "@alex_updated",
  "isActive": true
}

### Change user status
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/users/{{clientId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Reset user password
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/users/{{clientId}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "password": "NewStrongPass123"
}
